%% MUPP-067 Secret Santa draw year in Swedish time
%% How startDraw gets the year it files the draw under (R1).
flowchart TD
    A[Administrator starts the draw] --> B[today = swedishToday, Europe/Stockholm]
    B --> C[year = today.year, read once]
    C --> D[History: latest draw before year]
    D --> E[Delete left-over rows of year]
    E --> F[Insert the new rows under year]
